{
  "_about": "Real mdstream output, captured through a pipe with COLUMNS set, one input chunk at a time. segments[i] is what mdstream wrote after chunks[i]; the last segment is what it wrote at end of input. Used by compositor-block.test.ts to cut the stream at every offset.",
